---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const faqSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is there a DQ Kids Meal with a Blizzard?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. The standard Kids Meal includes a Vanilla Soft Serve Cone. If you want your child to have a Blizzard, order a Mini Blizzard separately starting at $3.49. The Mini is the right size for younger guests."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What age is the DQ Kids Meal for?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "DQ Kids Meals are recommended for children approximately 12 and under. There are no age restrictions — adults can order them if they prefer a smaller meal. The Kids Meal portion sizes are appropriate for younger children."
      }
    }
  ]
};
---
<Layout title="Dairy Queen Kids Meals Menu & Prices 2026 — DQ Kids Menu With Cone Included | The Queen Dairy Menu" description="Dairy Queen Kids Meals 2026 — all $4.99. Cheeseburger, 2-Pc Chicken Strips, or Hot Dog plus Fries or Applesauce, Milk or Drink, and a Vanilla Soft Serve Cone.">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />


<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb">
<div class="container"><ol>
<li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
<li><a href="/#full-menu">Menu</a></li>
<li aria-current="page">DQ Kids Meals Menu 2026</li>
</ol></div>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
<div class="container">
<div class="hero-content">
<span class="hero-eyebrow">Complete Kids Meals · All $4.99 · Cone Included</span>
<h1>DQ Kids Meals Menu 2026</h1>
</div>
</div>
</section>

  
<!-- AdX: before content -->
<div id="div-gpt-ad-thequeendairymenu_us-before_content">
  <script>
    googletag.cmd.push(function() { googletag.display('div-gpt-ad-thequeendairymenu_us-before_content'); });
  </script>
</div>

<section class="section"><div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;"><h2>DQ Kids Meals — Complete 2026 Guide</h2>
    <p>Dairy Queen Kids Meals are designed for younger guests and include everything needed for a complete meal — an entrée, a side, a drink, and a Vanilla Soft Serve Cone for dessert — all for $4.99. For the full DQ menu including adult options, visit <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
<!-- AdX: after paragraph 1 -->
<div id="div-gpt-ad-thequeendairymenu_us-paragraph">
  <script>
    googletag.cmd.push(function() { googletag.display('div-gpt-ad-thequeendairymenu_us-paragraph'); });
  </script>
</div>

    <h2>Kids Meal Options — Everything Included</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Kids Meal</th><th>Price</th><th>Entree</th><th>Side Options</th><th>Drink</th><th>Dessert</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Kids Cheeseburger Meal</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$4.99</td><td>Cheeseburger</td><td>Fries or Applesauce</td><td>Milk or Soft Drink</td><td>Vanilla Cone</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Kids 2-Pc Chicken Strips Meal</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$4.99</td><td>2 Chicken Strips</td><td>Fries or Applesauce</td><td>Milk or Soft Drink</td><td>Vanilla Cone</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Kids Hot Dog Meal</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$4.99</td><td>Classic Hot Dog</td><td>Fries or Applesauce</td><td>Milk or Soft Drink</td><td>Vanilla Cone</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
    <h2>Kids Meal Side Choices — Fries vs. Applesauce</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Regular Fries</strong> — The classic choice. Crispy golden fries, approximately 260 calories for the kids-size portion.</li>
      <li><strong>Applesauce</strong> — A lighter, no-sugar-added option at approximately 50 calories. A good choice if you want to balance the meal's nutritional profile.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Kids Meal Drink Options</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>1% Low-Fat Milk</strong> — 110 calories. The healthier choice, good source of calcium and protein.</li>
      <li><strong>Soft Drink (Coca-Cola products)</strong> — Available in kid-appropriate sizes. Coke, Sprite, Dr Pepper, and more depending on location.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What Makes DQ Kids Meals Stand Out</h2>
    <p>Every DQ Kids Meal includes a <strong>Vanilla Soft Serve Cone</strong> as a standard dessert — this is not an add-on or extra. At $4.99 total for an entrée, side, drink, and a soft serve cone, the DQ Kids Meal is genuinely excellent value compared to similar fast-food kids menus.</p>
    <p>The Vanilla Soft Serve Cone included in every Kids Meal is the same $2.39 cone sold separately — the Kids Meal gets it bundled into the $4.99 total price.</p>
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Is there a DQ Kids Meal with a Blizzard?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">No. The standard Kids Meal includes a Vanilla Soft Serve Cone. If you want your child to have a Blizzard, order a Mini Blizzard separately starting at $3.49. The Mini is the right size for younger guests.</div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What age is the DQ Kids Meal for?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">DQ Kids Meals are recommended for children approximately 12 and under. There are no age restrictions — adults can order them if they prefer a smaller meal. The Kids Meal portion sizes are appropriate for younger children.</div></div></div>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:32px;">For the full DQ menu including Blizzards, Stackburgers, Chicken Baskets, and DQ Cakes, visit <a href="/"><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu</strong></a>.</p></div></section>
<section class="section section-alt"><div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
<h2>Kids Meal Value — What It's Worth</h2>
<p>The DQ Kids Meal at $4.99 includes four components. Ordered individually: Kids Cheeseburger (~$5.00) + Fries ($2.49) + Milk ($1.49) + Vanilla Cone ($2.39) = ~$11.37. The $4.99 Kids Meal saves approximately $6.38. This makes it one of the best value deals on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a> for smaller appetites. Find all three Kids Meal options below.</p>
<h2>All Three DQ Kids Meals</h2>
<ul><li><a href="/items/kids-cheeseburger-meal">Kids Cheeseburger Meal — $4.99 (most popular)</a></li>
<li><a href="/items/kids-chicken-strips-meal">Kids 2-Piece Chicken Strips Meal — $4.99</a></li>
<li><a href="/items/kids-hot-dog-meal">Kids Hot Dog Meal — $4.99</a></li></ul>
<h2>All Include</h2>
<ul><li>Entrée (Cheeseburger, 2 Chicken Strips, or Hot Dog)</li>
<li>Side: Regular Fries or Applesauce</li>
<li>Drink: 1% Low-Fat Milk or Soft Drink</li>
<li>Dessert: Vanilla Soft Serve Cone — included at no extra charge</li></ul>
</div></section>

</Layout>
